ream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781129422226, "description": "AI-powered plant leaf disease identification from high-resolution leaf images. Detects disease lesion features (color, shape, distribution, surface deposits) such as white powdery patches (powdery mildew), rust-colored spore pustules (rust), brown necrotic spots (leaf spot), and outputs the most likely disease type with confidence score. Helps users quickly diagnose plant diseases and take timely measures. Scenarios: plant factories, greenhouses, home gardening, farm inspection. | 通过拍摄植物叶片的高清图像，利用AI视觉分析技术识别叶片上的病斑特征（颜色、形状、分布），检测是否有白色粉状物（白粉病）、锈色孢子堆（锈病）、褐色坏死斑（叶斑病）等典型症状，输出最可能的病害类型及置信度。帮助用户快速诊断植物病害，采取防治措施。应用场景：植物工厂、温室大棚、家庭盆栽、园艺养护。", "description_zh": "AI-powered plant leaf disease identification from high-resolution leaf images. Detects disease lesion features (color, shape, distribution, surface deposits) such as white powdery patches (powdery mildew), rust-colored spore pustules (rust), brown necrotic spots (leaf spot), and outputs the most likely disease type with confidence score. Helps users quickly diagnose plant diseases and take timely measures. Scenarios: plant factories, greenhouses, home gardening, farm inspection. | 通过拍摄植物叶片的高清图像，利用AI视觉分析技术识别叶片上的病斑特征（颜色、形状、分布），检测是否有白色粉状物（白粉病）、锈色孢子堆（锈病）、褐色坏死斑（叶斑病）等典型症状，输出最可能的病害类型及置信度。帮助用户快速诊断植物病害，采取防治措施。应用场景：植物工厂、温室大棚、家庭盆栽、园艺养护。", "downloads": 22, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_bb47e3e3/plant-leaf-disease-identification-analysis", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Plant Leaf Disease Identification | 植物叶片病害特征识别", "ownerName": "user_bb47e3e3", "score": 3600.654664484452, "slug": "plant-leaf-disease-identification-analysis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781465431858, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781156829590, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 22, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_922b1001/black-wrap", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Black Wrap", "ownerName": "user_922b1001", "score": 3600.654664484452, "slug": "black-wrap", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781465431852, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781140881546, "description": "Triggers when a user provides a litter-box area video URL or file for analysis; uses object detection and tracking to identify each cat's entry/exit times at the litter box, records daily usage frequency and per-visit duration (entry → exit), and compares against the historical baseline. When frequency rises/falls significantly, or per-visit duration is abnormally long/short, outputs a urinary-disease (cystitis, urinary obstruction, kidney disease) early-warning alert. Especially useful for individualized health management in multi-cat households. Application: multi-cat homes, catteries, vet hospital inpatient wards, boarding centers. Does NOT provide medical diagnosis — only outputs behavior-statistics-based alerts. | 当用户提供猫砂盆区域视频URL或文件时，触发本技能进行使用频次与时长分析；通过智能猫砂盆或固定摄像头分析视频，利用目标检测和跟踪技术识别每只猫咪进出猫砂盆的时刻，记录每日使用频次、单次停留时长（从进入至离开），并与历史基线对比；若频次显著增减或单次时长异常，则输出泌尿系统疾病（膀胱炎、尿闭、肾病等）预警，有助于多猫家庭的个体化管理及早发现健康问题。应用场景：多猫家庭、猫舍、宠物医院住院部、宠物寄养中心。仅输出基于行为统计的提示，不提供医疗诊断。", "description_zh": "Triggers when a user provides a litter-box area video URL or file for analysis; uses object detection and tracking to identify each cat's entry/exit times at the litter box, records daily usage frequency and per-visit duration (entry → exit), and compares against the historical baseline. When frequency rises/falls significantly, or per-visit duration is abnormally long/short, outputs a urinary-disease (cystitis, urinary obstruction, kidney disease) early-warning alert. Especially useful for individualized health management in multi-cat households. Application: multi-cat homes, catteries, vet hospital inpatient wards, boarding centers. Does NOT provide medical diagnosis — only outputs behavior-statistics-based alerts. | 当用户提供猫砂盆区域视频URL或文件时，触发本技能进行使用频次与时长分析；通过智能猫砂盆或固定摄像头分析视频，利用目标检测和跟踪技术识别每只猫咪进出猫砂盆的时刻，记录每日使用频次、单次停留时长（从进入至离开），并与历史基线对比；若频次显著增减或单次时长异常，则输出泌尿系统疾病（膀胱炎、尿闭、肾病等）预警，有助于多猫家庭的个体化管理及早发现健康问题。应用场景：多猫家庭、猫舍、宠物医院住院部、宠物寄养中心。仅输出基于行为统计的提示，不提供医疗诊断。", "downloads": 22, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_bb47e3e3/litter-box-usage-monitor-analysis", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Pet Litter Box Usage Monitor (Frequency & Duration) | 宠物猫砂盆使用频次与时长", "ownerName": "user_bb47e3e3", "score": 3600.654664484452, "slug": "litter-box-usage-monitor-analysis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781465431841, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781157144693, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 22, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_922b1001/flutter-wrap", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Flutter Wrap", "ownerName": "user_922b1001", "score": 3600.654664484452, "slug": "flutter-wrap", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781465431832, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_use